stateDiagram-v2
  %% Source: CampaignStateMachine.Evaluate(taskCount, completedTaskCount), recomputed by
  %% CampaignRepository.RefreshStatusAsync. The state is a pure function of the campaign's tasks.
  %% A cancelled task does not count as completed, so a campaign that holds one stays in_progress.
  [*] --> open: campaign created, no tasks
  open --> in_progress: first task added
  in_progress --> completed: all tasks completed
  completed --> in_progress: a task reopens or a new task is added
  in_progress --> open: all tasks detached/deleted
  completed --> open: all tasks detached/deleted
